, la solidità della sua famiglia sembra andare in crisi… Vivere questa complessa situazione familiare spingerà Leone a riflettere sulla vera natura del “filo invisibile” che lo lega ai suoi papà e a tutti coloro che hanno voluto la sua nascita."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Invisible Thread","overview":"The teenage son of two fathers makes a documentary film about his parents but is surprised when a real-life plot twist occurs in his family.","tagline":"A movie about a family like any other."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qQwEDjypPHSVGvseGkkbedOraEI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uouDZk79SVDyW4HuTVO108zmLbW.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":879440,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qQwEDjypPHSVGvseGkkbedOraEI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qQwEDjypPHSVGvseGkkbedOraEI.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qQwEDjypPHSVGvseGkkbedOraEI.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qQwEDjypPHSVGvseGkkbedOraEI.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bHukHtEKdXoHdd3AOY65PsBdT4X.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bHukHtEKdXoHdd3AOY65PsBdT4X.jpg","language":"it","width":1382,"height":2048},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7FMWQWk0MhT6oKt5Q2AED7nSI6M.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7FMWQWk0MhT6oKt5Q2AED7nSI6M.jpg","language":"it","width":683,"height":1024},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iGHvtTy4HOKTP5ExgBugKK9LHyx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iGHvtTy4HOKTP5ExgBugKK9LHyx.jpg","language":"it","width":1929,"heigh